===Alternative forms===
* [[Hallowe'en]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''Halloween'''

# The [[eve]] of [[All Hallows' Day]]; 31st [[October]]; celebrated (mostly in the [[United Kingdom]], [[Canada]], [[United States]] and [[Ireland]]) by [[children]] going [[door-to-door]] in [[costumes]] and demanding [[candy]] with [[menace]]s.

